<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 11.8 points to 757.3.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 11.8 points to 757.3.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 11.8 points on Friday to 757.3, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the investment fund index losing the most, down 29 points, or 2.92 percent, to 964.3 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
